            <ArticleTitle>sICAM-1 measurements are independent of processing method and sampling site in patients with coronary artery disease.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>307-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>sICAM-1 measurements are here shown to be independent of processing method (serum, platelet rich and platelet poor plasma) and sampling size (venous or arterial blood) in patients with coronary disease.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
